        "original_id": "329fe40e-cc5d-5620-8c54-e3ed31265f43",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Walken, Allison Williams, Taylor Louderman\n- Works: Peter Pan Live!, Peter Pan, The Deer Hunter\n- Organizations: NBC\n- Places: Grumman Studios, Bethpage, New York\n- Roles: Captain Hook, Wendy, Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Taylor Louderman appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan.\"\n- Peter Pan Live! featured a live television production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\" from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York.\n- In Peter Pan Live!, Allison Williams starred in the title role and Christopher Walken played Captain Hook.\n- During his career, Christopher Walken won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for playing Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
